{"parse": {"title": "WFS-02", "pageid": 64960, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/WFS-01\" title=\"WFS-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">WFS-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/WFS-03\" title=\"WFS-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">WFS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.B4.E6.97.B6.E6.BC.94.E5.91.98\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"临时演员\">临时演员</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 临时演员</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Impromptu Actors</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>平<span class=\"color-value\"></span>平<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>奇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>主<span class=\"color-value\"></span>角<span class=\"color-value\"></span>和<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>值<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>提<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>配<span class=\"color-value\"></span>角<span class=\"color-value\"></span>能<span class=\"color-value\"></span>演<span class=\"color-value\"></span>出<span class=\"color-value\"></span>什<span class=\"color-value\"></span>么<span class=\"color-value\"></span>热<span class=\"color-value\"></span>播<span class=\"color-value\"></span>剧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>情<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191502</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>3月12日18:22，天气雨。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>入住夜枭旅馆的主角一夜无眠，她满脑子想的都是关于德州的种种传闻——由不幸、死亡和犯罪串联起的三个顶点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>传闻。这里最不缺的就是传闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306017.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-306017.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306017.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306017.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-306017.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306017.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-306017.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306017.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>所以我讨厌《救猫咪》和方法论——这个配角就该在这里出场！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306016.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306016.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>不过……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>故事的主角曾在汽车旅馆中工作，她试图想象了一些传闻，可那些都不够真实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她听见房客们兴奋的议论声。她听见“脑浆”、“断头”等字眼，还有“幽灵”什么的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她暗自做下了一个决定。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">旅馆老板：</div><div>……你要在我这里工作？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">旅馆老板：</div><div>对于像你这样的年轻人来说，你大可以去赌场或者俱乐部赚钱，那里的小费更高。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">旅馆老板：</div><div>尤其是如果你想要进娱乐圈当模特的话……去那里能结交真正有身份的顾客。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>我要赎回我的邀请函，在电影节结束之前赶出新的剧本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">旅馆老板：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">旅馆老板：</div><div>我衷心希望你能尽早完成你的剧本，没准哪一天你能成为至尊神探狄克·崔西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">旅馆老板：</div><div>但在那之前，你该为我们的客人准备晚餐了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>哈，我早就想说——这个旅馆里的餐点实在太差劲了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>你认识到了这个问题，说明你至少不是一个讨人厌的自大狂——合作愉快，老板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿在料理台上找到一份采购清单和几张购物优惠券，还有一张明亮的粉红色纸上印着一则停水通知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>水池很干净，没有食物污渍。硬木地板上一尘不染，只有一块和其他部分颜色不一致的浅色刷痕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>这是什么？刷痕吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿打开了水池下面的柜子，里面的气味闻起来像是柠檬味的氨水。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_jiuba\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_jiuba\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>晚上十点十分，金蜜儿将前台的收音机据为己有，用它来播放音乐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>烤小牛排搭配马沙拉白葡萄酒酱，装在一个个大碗里摆在桌子上。一罐罐的酱汁正放在壁炉架上加热。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>酱汁罐子的上方挂着一把手枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>噢！真是一把漂亮的手枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>老板，这有什么我不知道的混乱状况发生吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">旅馆老板：</div><div>……哈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">旅馆老板：</div><div>现在不是闲聊的时候，你可以去干活了，小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿听见刀叉在碗碟上发出的当啷声，旅馆大堂已经开始拥进第一批房客来吃晚餐的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>晚上好！这位女士！您需要来点喝的吗？咖啡、茶、水，还是来点更烈的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">普娜：</div><div>水就好了，亲爱的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>好的，女士！这瓶水是32美元的噢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">普娜：</div><div>什么——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>嘿呀！真是个标致的小妞！你招到了一个不错的厨子啊，老板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一位醉醺醺的男房客几近吼叫地对她说话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>天啊，真是个性感美女。你应该是美国人吧？我是巴黎人，最近才被调派到德州，寂寞得很。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>那您的法语水平如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>你应该很清楚，我只懂法式接吻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>那看来你的脑子只能思考一件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>那你呢，麻布基特【Ma petite】？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>老天！你的法语果然很烂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>老板，我喜欢你的这位新服务员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她毫不在乎他们的玩笑话，因为她对这类人了如指掌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们虽算不上模范房客，却有许多人无法拥有的东西，比如每日八卦时间，其中就有她感兴趣的传闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>嗯？这么晚了你要出门吗，老板？你手里怎么拎着油漆桶？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">旅馆老板：</div><div>你应该已经看过通知了，明天这里停水，所以我要去市中心采购些应急货物。门口有东西送来，把它放到酒窖里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>哇噢，是一箱布里斯托尔奶油雪利酒——说起来，这家旅馆竟然有地下酒窖吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>当然，这家旅馆的前主人斯塔尔先生是一个真正的美酒鉴赏家——他甚至建造了一座酒窖，就在你的脚底下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>旅馆老板就是当年负责建造酒窖的工人之一，从那时起就一直在为斯塔尔先生工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>后来斯塔尔先生失踪了，他就暂代了老板的职务——嗝！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>醉醺醺的男人打了一个酒嗝，金蜜儿嫌恶地扭过了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>斯塔尔先生现在在哪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>……斯塔尔先生失踪了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>就在他失踪的当天晚上，还爆发了森林火灾。解释为巧合很难令人信服，是吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>但警方最后得出的结论是，他们并不认为斯塔尔先生是被人绑架或者杀害了，而是他主动选择消失的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>我一直在怀疑斯塔尔先生是不是还活在某个地方，或者说变成了幽灵，就在这附近徘徊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>幽灵……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>不过想想他痴迷的那些诗歌，还有他经历的那个烂事……说不定他早就为自己选好了躲藏的地点，只等时机成熟，然后就……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>斯塔尔先生经历了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>他的妻子被谋杀了啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿看到他往酒杯里倒入32美元的矿泉水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>那个发生火灾的森林是在哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>我记得警方通报好像说是在距离这里大约四英里的森林吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>难不成你想去那里探险？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>麻布吉特，你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金发女孩儿打断了他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>我想你要说的是，我的样子真的很像恐怖片中的受害人吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>凭你的金发、体形和外表，的确合适。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>哈，疯子和罪犯最喜欢找我这样的人——当然，我保证他们会为自己的无知付出代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将账单拍在了桌面上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306016.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306016.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>32美元！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306016.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306016.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>你好，客房服务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿推着餐车，来到了客房的门口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>楼梯深处的黑暗不断蔓延。她感觉到一种难以抗拒的吸引力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306016.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306016.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>开门！送餐服务！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>汪！汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伴随着狗叫声，紧闭的门扉被打开了，一个憔悴的女人出现在了她的面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的房间墙上挂满了照片——看来，她在年轻时曾是一名喜剧演员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">朱迪：</div><div>斯塔尔！你得帮我弄更多“雪利酒”过来……你能帮我吗？我知道你有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>你认错人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">朱迪：</div><div>该死的，该死的！四个月前你可不是这么说的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>……见鬼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">朱迪：</div><div>……你害得我只能用那些稀释烂货了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那只狗忽然叫了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">朱迪：</div><div>放心，芬尼，我不会让小杰克看到的……芬尼！我们下次再找小杰克玩，好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芬尼：</div><div>汪呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗芬尼发出呜咽声，一双哀怨的眼睛盯着走廊尽头的楼梯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>很好。暴风雨旅馆、失踪的前主人、疯言疯语的房客，还有身怀秘密的老板……就在刚刚芬尼还指认了一个新角色。我想要的元素全都齐全了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她朝走廊尽头的楼梯走去。那种吸引力又出现了。她向上迈出脚步，楼梯在她的靴子底下发出警告的嘎吱声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306016.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306016.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>哈，新要素……一个上锁的阁楼——这里也有蓝胡子吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将钥匙尖端对准锯齿状的锁孔，插入，扭转。她听到一声清脆的“咔嗒”。随后，门开了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只老鼠沿着踢脚线惊惶奔跑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这间阁楼里摆着一张四柱床，床铺没整理，金蜜儿把手伸进被子，柔软的触感令人生疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她把被子和枕头全都翻起来看，在枕头下方发现一张照片，照片下面有一行小字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306016.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306016.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-306016.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306016.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>“祝你生日快乐，宝贝。海因兹·斯塔尔与杰克·斯塔尔，摄于1983年。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>照片上的男人搂着一个男孩。男孩则抱着一个与他自己如出一辙的等身玩偶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>看来这里应该就是杰克·斯塔尔的房间了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-563520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-563520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-563520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>嗦嗦……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个声音突然从金蜜儿的背后传来，是有人吸鼻涕的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>……声音是从衣柜里传出来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她蹑手蹑脚走到衣柜前，门上有个小小的孔洞。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将手电筒对着孔洞照去，光线在堆叠的衣物上游移，接着就找到了她要找的目标。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张男孩的脸。和照片中的男孩一模一样的脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306021.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306021.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩的双眼在黑暗中闪烁，那里面漆黑一片，如同幼兽。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "WFS-02"}}